# NORMAL-THROW rig (14z-104, coverage matrix): P1 (poke-chosen) walks to
# point-blank and inputs a forward normal throw (6+HP held 4 frames,
# twice, spaced). The victim is a no-input dummy (P2 poke-chosen; a
# dummy cannot tech, so the throw must connect). Used by
# audit_tenant_throws.sh for every tenant as thrower AND as victim.
300-305 sys=C1
420-425 sys=C2
800-803 sys=S1
940-943 sys=S2
1100-1102 p2=R
1160-1162 p2=R
1300-1302 p1=1
1360-1362 p2=1
2860-3005 p1=R
3010-3014 p1=R3
3100-3104 p1=R3
5000 wait
